# AI-Skills Core Rules

- At session start and after context reset, read and apply `core/session-start/SKILL.md`, which loads Ponytail by default.

- Follow the standards defined in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
- Skill directories must match frontmatter `name` in kebab-case.
- Run `python scripts/validate-skills.py` to verify skills locally.
- Use `.github/pull_request_template.md` format for pull request summaries.
